ion.", "options": [{"text": "0.1", "added": false}, {"text": "4", "added": false}, {"text": "10", "added": false}, {"text": "1", "added": false}], "options_source": "real", "image_only": false, "topic": "Simplification", "sub": "bodmas", "key_answer": "10"}, {"n": 27, "text": "Two trains of equal length are running on parallel lines in the same direction at speeds of 112 km/h and 46 km/h. The faster train passes the slower train in 12 seconds. The length of each train is:", "options": [{"text": "110 meters", "added": false}, {"text": "113 meters", "added": false}, {"text": "122 meters", "added": false}, {"text": "103 meters", "added": false}], "options_source": "real", "image_only": false, "topic": "Trains", "sub": "train-vs-platform", "key_answer": "110 meters"}, {"n": 28, "text": "Gursimar was given an increment of 15% on her salary. If her new salary is ₹84,180, what was her salary before the increment?", "options": [{"text": "₹72,300", "added": false}, {"text": "₹73,200", "added": false}, {"text": "₹73,050", "added": false}, {"text": "₹72,750", "added": false}], "options_source": "real", "image_only": false, "topic": "Percentage", "sub": "basic-percentage", "key_answer": "₹73,200"}, {"n": 29, "text": "Two pipes can fill a cistern separately in 40 minutes and 60 minutes, respectively. They can together fill the cistern in:", "options": [{"text": "24 minutes", "added": false}, {"text": "23 minutes", "added": false}, {"text": "25 minutes", "added": false}, {"text": "20 minutes", "added": false}], "options_source": "real", "image_only": false, "topic": "Pipes-Cisterns", "sub": "combined-pipes", "key_answer": "24 minutes"}, {"n": 30, "text": "A merchant buys 150 books for ₹200 each and sells them at ₹250 each. Calculate the profit percentage.", "options": [{"text": "25%", "added": false}, {"text": "15%", "added": false}, {"text": "25.5%", "added": false}, {"text": "35%", "added": false}], "options_source": "real", "image_only": false, "topic": "Profit-Loss", "sub": "